---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Contact Us" description="Get in touch with the Acupressure Guide team. Send questions, feedback, or suggestions about our acupressure guides and resources." breadcrumbs={[{ label: "Home", href: "/" }, { label: "Contact", href: "/contact" }]} schema={{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"ContactPoint","contactType":"customer support","email":"hello@acupressureguide.com","url":"https://www.acupressureguide.com/contact","availableLanguage":"English"}}>
<div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 lg:px-6"><h1 class="mb-4">Contact</h1><p class="text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 text-lg mb-8">Have a question, suggestion, or feedback? We'd love to hear from you.</p><p class="text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-300 mb-4">For general inquiries, reach out to us at:</p><p class="text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-200 font-medium"><a href="mailto:hello@acupressureguide.com" class="text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 hover:underline">hello@acupressureguide.com</a></p>

<section id="what-we-can-help-with" class="mb-8"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100 mb-3">What We Can Help With</h2><p class="text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-300 leading-relaxed mb-3">We are happy to hear from you about questions on how to perform a specific acupressure technique, requests for more detail on an existing guide, corrections when you spot an error or something that is unclear, and general feedback about the site. Suggestions for new topics are especially welcome &mdash; reader questions often become future guides.</p><p class="text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-300 leading-relaxed mb-3">To help us give you a useful answer, it helps if your email includes:</p><ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300"><li>The page URL or title you have a question about</li><li>Your question or suggestion, with as much detail as you like</li><li>Relevant context, such as the point or technique you were using</li></ul></section>

<section id="response-times" class="mb-8"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100 mb-3">Response Times</h2><p class="text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-300 leading-relaxed">We read every message and aim to reply within a few business days. At busier times it may take a little longer, and because we are a small team, we cannot guarantee a response to every message. If your matter is urgent, please allow extra time or seek professional help.</p></section>

<section id="faq" class="mb-8"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100 mb-3">Frequently Asked Questions</h2><div class="space-y-4"><details class="rounded-xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-4 dark:border-stone-800 dark:bg-stone-900"><summary class="font-semibold mb-1 cursor-pointer">Do you provide medical advice?</summary><p class="text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400 mt-1">No. We are not a medical service. Our guides are for education only, and we cannot diagnose conditions or recommend treatments for your specific situation. Please consult a qualified healthcare professional for health concerns.</p></details><details class="rounded-xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-4 dark:border-stone-800 dark:bg-stone-900"><summary class="font-semibold mb-1 cursor-pointer">Can I request a topic?</summary><p class="text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400 mt-1">Yes. We regularly turn reader questions into new guides and updates. Send us your suggestion and we will add it to our content roadmap.</p></details><details class="rounded-xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-4 dark:border-stone-800 dark:bg-stone-900"><summary class="font-semibold mb-1 cursor-pointer">Do you accept partnerships or press inquiries?</summary><p class="text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400 mt-1">Yes. For partnerships, collaborations, or press questions, please email us with a short description of your request and we will do our best to get back to you.</p></details></div></section>

<hr class="my-8 border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-700"><p class="text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">If you have a medical question, please consult a qualified healthcare professional. We cannot provide individual health advice.</p></div>
</BaseLayout>
